Z||000000||coolcat||06-08-2001||03:26 PM||||After totaling my 87GT and driving a 92 Camaro for the past 2 months I've come to a conclusion 1.I really miss my car 2.call me crazy but I don't like power steering .The Camaro has power steering and in my opinion you totally loose the feeling of the road. If I was to ever be offered the option to put power steering in my Fiero I don't think I would. Does anyone else feel this way?<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headbang.gif"> Gettin good players is easy,gettin them to play together is the hard part||||reg||13
